@startuml 01_use_case
'============================================================
' AI Study Mentor — Use Case Diagram (OVERVIEW)
' Đối chiếu: Assignment part 1, Activity 3 (M1)
'
' Cấu trúc: actor nối tới 7 use case cấp cao nhất.
' Chi tiết FR1..FR10 nằm ở 01b_use_case_detail.puml
'============================================================

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F7F8FC
skinparam packageBorderColor #8A90B8
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #3F4390
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam usecaseArrowColor #3F4390
skinparam actorBorderColor #3F4390
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #EEF0FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #3F4390
skinparam rectangleFontStyle bold
skinparam linetype ortho

actor "Student\n(học sinh: trung school → university)" as Student #EEF0FB
actor "Google\nGemini API" as Gemini <<external system>>

rectangle "AI Study Mentor" {
  usecase "<<FR1 + FR2>>\nManage account\n& complete onboarding" as UC1
  usecase "<<FR3 + FR4 + FR5>>\nAsk a question and\nget instant answer" as UC3
  usecase "<<FR6>>\nUse my library\n(history, search, bookmark)" as UC6
  usecase "<<FR7>>\nPractise with\nAI-generated questions" as UC7
  usecase "<<FR8 + FR9>>\nTrack progress,\nearn XP and badges" as UC8
  usecase "<<FR10>>\nReceive notifications\nand reminders" as UC10
  usecase "<<N1 + N3>>\nTrust the app\n(security & privacy)" as UCN
}

Student -- UC1
Student -- UC3
Student -- UC6
Student -- UC7
Student -- UC8
Student -- UC10
Student -- UCN

Gemini ..> UC3 : <<generates answer>>
Gemini ..> UC7 : <<generates questions>>

UC1  ..> UC3  : <<include>>\nready to ask
UC3  ..> UC6  : <<include>>\nanswer auto-saved
UC6  ..> UC7  : <<extend>>\ngenerate from history
UC3  ..> UC8  : <<extend>>\n+1 question, +XP
UC7  ..> UC8  : <<extend>>\n+accuracy, +XP
UC8  ..> UC10 : <<extend>>\nsummaries & streaks
UC6  ..> UC10 : <<extend>>\nbookmark reminder

note bottom of UCN
  <b>Giới hạn đã biết — nêu thẳng trong design document:</b>
  Leaderboard (FR9) chỉ tính trên chính thiết bị này,
  <b>không phải</b> bảng xếp hạng toàn cục — MVP chưa có server.
end note

note right of Gemini
  <b>Hệ thống ngoài phạm vi phát triển.</b>
  Brief: "AI integration (ChatGPT, Google Gemini)"
  → chọn <b>Gemini</b>: free tier cho sinh viên,
  không cần server trung gian.
end note

@enduml
